                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Forty-eight resolutions were adopted by the Rio Economic Conference. The United
                    States voted in favor of 40 and abstained on 8 (Resolutions numbered 25/54,
                    32/54, 36/54, 37/54, 45/54, 48/54, 62/54, and 66/54). For text of the statements
                    of abstention made by the United States Delegation, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >USDel</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Report: Quitandinha</hi>, Appendices 11, 15, 7–9, 12–14,
                    respectively.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
